        {
          "from": "Proto-Muskogean *hisi [s] 'hair'",
          "to": "Choctaw and Chickasaw hishi [ʃ]",
          "note": "Historical merger of *s with *š as /ʃ/ west of the Mobile–Black Warrior line, not an allophonic rule. Proto-Muskogean is a reconstructed stage. Compare Alabama and Koasati hissi, Creek esse."
